/backups/

# Root-level DB dumps (e.g. a stray mysqldump saved outside backups/) — the
# leading "/" anchors this to the repo root only, so it does NOT touch
# prisma/migrations/**/migration.sql, which must stay tracked.
/*.sql

# Defensive: catches an Ed25519 private key ever generated INTO the repo by
# mistake (LICENSE_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH is meant to point outside it entirely —
# see scripts/generate-signing-keys.ts and scripts/generate-keypair.ts).
*.pem
*_private_key*
*private-key*
